lty of most Muslims. Each side would recognise the other and give it legitimacy. Thus the Buyids adopted and largely gave shape to the main ‘Twelver’ subdivision of Shi’ism, in which the twelfth ‘leader’ is held to have disappeared.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 888, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 811})
